## Scenarios

### freeze panes: core
_Freeze leading rows/columns and query the frozen extent._

#### starts with nothing frozen

- Verify: starts with nothing frozen
   - Expected: has_frozen_panes(layout) is false
   - Expected: frozen_extent(layout) equals `R0C0`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: starts with nothing frozen")
val layout = default_view_layout()
expect(has_frozen_panes(layout)).to_equal(false)
expect(frozen_extent(layout)).to_equal("R0C0")
```

</details>

